    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You have trained to fight extraplanar threats to Eberron. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws against extraplanar creatures, and you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to damage with weapons and unarmed attacks against them. If your attack would deal more than one weapon die of damage (as is common at higher levels than 1st), the bonus is equal to the number of weapon dice or unarmed attack dice. </p>"
